<title>DENMARK: Lauritzen H1 loss grows to 199 mln DKK.</title>
<headline>Lauritzen H1 loss grows to 199 mln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>					 (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Net result after minorities   199 loss vs 39* loss</p>
<p> Group turnover		  7,856	vs 7,942**</p>
<p>*Revised from loss 126 milllion</p>
<p>** Revised from 7.917 milllion</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish shipping and shipbuilding group is J.Lauritzen A/S. It said in a statement that it expected a second-half loss of 100 million crowns and a full-year loss of 300 million crowns.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom + 45-33-969650</p>
</text>
